    {
      "id": "p0200-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that this line includes a reference to Disaster Report, a PlayStation 2 game from 2003. This led to an unexpected issue, though - Disaster Report originally went by a very different name in Japan: Zettai Zetsumei Toshi (\"City of Certain Doom\").",
        "raw": "Toby noted that this line includes a reference to Disaster Report, a PlayStation\n2 game from 2003. This led to an unexpected issue, though - Disaster Report\noriginally went by a very different name in Japan: Zettai Zetsumei Toshi (\"City\nof Certain Doom\").",
